   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to WWF/Sweden for financing of several of WWF&apos;s regional and global programmes. These include 1) Marine, 2) Freshwater, 3) Climate Change, and the 4) Toxics programmes. It also includes 5) capacity building within the TRAFFIC programme and a regional SEAsia policy programme. It also includes a small grants part and a policy part on environmental economics and poverty alleviation.</narrative>
